'''Landing bay one-tac-one''' was a [[hangar]] bay present within the [[Tipoca City Military Complex]] on the [[planet]] [[Kamino]]. After returning from a [[Battle of Kaller|mission]] to [[Kaller]], [[Clone Force 99]] used the hangar bay to house their [[Starship|ship]], the [[Marauder (Omicron-class)|''Marauder'']].<ref name="Aftermath">{{TBB|Aftermath (episode)}}</ref>

